WEBVTT

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.330
looking like he's about to pass out,

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:34.163
trying to save the situation

00:00:34.197 --> 00:00:37.397
and get the kid to run
in the right direction.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:42.997
In many ways, that's what it's like
for many young people in Africa.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:45.597
They're many paces behind their peers

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:48.530
on the other side
of the inequality divide,

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.797
and they're also running
in the wrong direction.

00:00:52.197 --> 00:00:54.797
Because as much as we might
wish otherwise,

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.863
and aspire to build
economic and social systems

00:00:58.863 --> 00:01:00.530
where it’s not the case,